"bb_tag\" >______________________________________________________________________</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>This game was developed by one person. If you wish to participate in the development or support the developer, you can find everything on Discord. Thank you!</u></i></strong><br><strong><i><u></u></i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960250/extras/4f6b1774f54c5d1674a0cd20c5d333ec.poster.avif?t=1753498647\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960250/extras/4f6b1774f54c5d1674a0cd20c5d333ec.webm?t=1753498647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2960250/extras/4f6b1774f54c5d1674a0cd20c5d333ec.mp4?t=1753498647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
